### Using `elif`

::: {#cell-3 .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
x=0

if x > 0:
    sign = "Positive!"
elif x < 0:
    sign = "Negative!"
else: sign = "Zero!"

print(sign)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}
```
Zero!
```
:::
:::


